			"notes": "Release Drop by commit [ab5f1ea] two commit later\nfeat(client): overhaul RShift flow, Mod Hub & HUD editor + major fixes\n\n- Fix Gamma hook (SimpleOption.getValue via GammaMixin, no external mod)\n- Fix Inventory Hub (remove hotbar, keep main inventory only)\n- Fix RShift crash (remove redundant renderBackground blur issue)\n- Fix Totem damage signature for 1.21.8\n\n- Add new RShift Flow:\n  + HUD Editor with live preview\n  + Central Mod Hub button + logo support\n  + Auto language sync with game\n\n- New Mod Hub:\n  + Modules tab (11 mods toggle + config per mod)\n  + Settings tab (overlays/utilities)\n\n- Per-mod config screens (Sprint, Freelook, Zoom, Gamma, etc.)\n- Rewrite Sneak/Sprint system (Hold / Toggle / Vanilla modes)\n- Rewrite Freelook (true camera lock LAlt third-person)\n- New HUD Editor system (drag, snap grid, scale, presets)\n\n- Update Coordinates HUD format with biome color\n- Improve HUD editor UX (scroll scale, reset, presets)\n\n- Remove External Mod Detector\n- Remove separate config language system"
